            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: A creature hits the seamer with a melee Strike\n\nEvery Skinsaw seamer keeps a sewing needle attached to a loop of thick silk, wrapped loosely around their hand not holding a weapon, which they can use in combat to snag or disarm attackers; ; The seamer attempts an Athletics check to either Grapple or Disarm the triggering creature."
